# Keeps the empty backend/ai/checkpoints/ directory in Git.
#
# Real checkpoint files are NEVER committed. Checkpoint selection is server-side
# only and its contents are git-ignored (see the repo .gitignore:
# `backend/ai/checkpoints/*` with `!backend/ai/checkpoints/.gitkeep`). No model
# or checkpoint is downloaded or chosen in Phase 1 task P1-001.
